WEBVTT

00:30:26.490 --> 00:30:30.420
You're literally teaching
the clinician, or the doc,

00:30:30.444 --> 00:30:35.436
the words to use
to express their intention of care.

00:30:35.460 --> 00:30:37.350
And they forget.

00:30:37.374 --> 00:30:41.896
I can't tell you how many times,
over and over and over again,

00:30:41.920 --> 00:30:47.686
we saw them simply forget
to say, "I care about you.

00:30:47.710 --> 00:30:49.456
I'm in this with you.

00:30:49.480 --> 00:30:51.574
We're going to figure this out together."

00:30:51.598 --> 00:30:57.694
(Music)

00:30:58.020 --> 00:31:00.546
AG: And there's the genius
of Adrienne's approach.